     jinja_env.add_extension('jinja2.ext.debug')
 
 
+Application translation versions
+--------------------------------
+
+The i18n extension can track application versions for exact messages.
+``env.set_translation_version(message, version)`` accepts strings and
+updates that message. ``env.get_translation_version(message)`` returns
+the stored string or ``None`` for an unknown message.
+``env.compare_translation_versions(first, second)`` is true only when
+both messages are registered with equal versions. Missing messages never
+compare equal, even when both are missing.
+
+``env.remove_translation_version(message)`` removes one entry, ignoring
+unknown messages. ``env.clear_translation_versions()`` removes them all.
+Empty, Unicode and long strings are accepted without prescribing hashes
+or storage. Each Environment has its own state; an overlay starts with a
+copy and later changes in either environment are isolated. Version
+tracking does not replace providers or change rendering and extraction.
+
 .. _i18n-extension:
 
 i18n Extension
